#nop =====================================================
#nop LOCAL GROUP CONFIG (EXAMPLE)
#nop Copy this file to `config/local_group.tin` and set your own leader and
#nop followers. This file is gitignored — only the .example is tracked.
#nop =====================================================

#nop The leader is the character who runs `group new`, starts logging, and
#nop whose session log the map window watches.
#VARIABLE {leader} {Mutiny}

#nop List every character that should auto-follow the leader on login.
#nop The leader should NOT be in this list.
#list {followers} {create} {Haenym} {Prodigy} {Rancor}
